      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - After a certain amount of time, Thirios summons a wolf to fight with him, summoning {0}. Wolves have basic stats equal to {1}% of Thirios' stats. Every normal attack of wolves has {2}% chance of inflicting poison on the enemy.
