      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - When Thirios's wolf dies, he gets angry and smashes the ground, causing {0} (+ {1}% his HP) of physical damage to a large area and stunning affected enemies for {2}s. After performing the attack, Thirios and his other wolves gain {3}% critical damage and {4}% lifesteal for {5}s.
