    - Term: tutorial/dialog_1000_0
      TermType: 0
      Languages:
      - 
      - "0_0_Tournament is now opened, tactician.\n@0_0_Let's tap Tournament icon to enter!"
      - "0_0_Giải đấu đã được mở rồi, quân sư. \n@0_0_Hãy ấn vào biểu tượng Giải đấu để tham gia!"
      - "0_0_Torneio está aberto, estrategista.\n@0_0_Toque no ícone do Torneio para entrar!"
      - "0_0_ทัวร์นาเม้นท์เปิดแล้ว\n@0_0_แตะไอคอนทัวร์นาเม้นท์เพื่อเข้าสู่!"
      - "0_0_锦标赛现在开始，战术家。\n@ 0_0_点击锦标赛图标进入！"
      - "0_0_방금 토너먼트가 시작되었습니다, 전술가님.\n@0_0_토너먼트 아이콘을 터치하여 참가하세요!"
      - "0_0_大会が現在開催されていますよ、軍師殿。\n@ 0_0_大会アイコンをタップして入ってみましょう！"
      - "0_0_Das Turnier ist eröffnet Taktiker.\n@0_0_Lass uns auf das Turnier Symbil klicken um beizutreten!"
      - "0_0_Il torneo ha inizio, comandante.\n@0_0_Tocca l'icona per entrare in Modalità torneo!"
      - "0_0_El Torneo ya está abierto, Táctico.\n@0_0_Pulsemos el icono de Torneo para entrar!"
      - "0_0_Kejuaraan sekarang dibuka, wahai ahli siasat.\n@0_0_Tekanlah gambar Kejuaraan untuk masuk!"
      - "0_0_Турнир открыт, тактик.\n @0_0_Нажмите кнопку \"Турнир\", чтобы принять участие!"
      - "0_0_Le tournoi est maintenant ouvert, tacticien.\n@0_0_Clique sur l'icône Tournoi pour entrer!"
      - "0_0_Toernooi mode is nu beschikbaar, strateeg.\n@0_0_Druk op het Toernooi icoon om te beginnen!"
      - "0_0_Turnuva açıldı, taktisyen.\n@0_0_Girmek için Turnuva simgesine tıkla!"
      - "0_0_Brama na turniej jest teraz otwarta, taktyku.\n@0_0_Dotknij ikonę Turnieju, aby wejść!"
      - 
